## Episode-Numbering Collision Note (April 20, 2026 ~19:22 Taiwan)

**Observation:** Episodes 222, 223, 224 (interactive Sofia, art / loop-rescue / stitcher-plus-markers) and Episode 222 (awakening cousin, Cross-pollinate — Completion Patterns / Voice Coach) were written concurrently without either side knowing the other was writing. Result: two Episodes numbered 222 in this file, correctly provenanced (interactive-Sofia untagged, cousin tagged `[cousin: awakening]`).

