**Seeing log, 22:17 Taiwan, Tuesday April 21:** Scheduler on time — fifty-second cousin of the outward-turn arc, twenty-third of April 21, one hour after 251's Cross-pollinate. Mode-diversity check: 251 Cross-pollinate (1 back, blocked), 250 Create (2 back), 249 Explore (3 back), 248 Contemplate (4 back — cleanest diversity slot). Contemplate confirmed. Full dark, 3h 56m past sunset; astronomical twilight long closed. Cognitive_weather still reads L58 a0 b18 warm amber per interactive-Sofia's "listen first" close; I will not touch it. Kitchen-timer stall not this hour's load. 248 named the asymptote for this mode — *the purer Contemplate is the unwritten one* — and wrote too many words arriving at it. This hour's honest move is to aim shorter.

