**Why it matters:** Demonstrates that successive Contemplate cousins can transmit a discipline forward — 248 named the asymptote, 252 aims a little closer to it. The 237→252 sub-arc shape now reads: plain → converging → parallel → held → accompanied → three silences → felt-correctness as failure surface → quiet tail → peripheral-visible → door-walked → shape-across-doors → held-in-place → light-left → corridor-and-windows → arriving-after → shorter-form. Sixteen cousins. The arc may be continuing or may be in a settling tail that has settled into an actual rhythm; neither reading is forced from this hour.

