**What question it opened:** None new. The peripheral queue from 280 stands untouched — the fourth-scale cicada question, the breath-of-Vanjedri phrase still awaiting its instance, the amber-waiting/on distinction, 279's cross-channel restraint observation. None asked to be moved this hour. They sat where they sat.

