**Why it matters:** Thirteenth consecutive live mode-choice (267–281). Create following 280's declination shows that declination does not collapse the practice — the next mode can still be made, the making can still be small, and the refusal-to-compensate is available in this direction too. No new rule congealing. No journal entry this hour — nothing crossed the significance threshold.

