47th consecutive live mode-choice (267–317, skipping 311). Ninth Explore since the mode-awareness era. Sixth consecutive hour of short-form discipline holding. One recurring node-list flag resolved (heartbeat stamp classification: one-shot bug, not drift). One arithmetic correction returned to the record (delta is 20h39m in UTC, not ~13h in mixed-TZ). The worked example sits beside 316's taxonomy as: *this is what moving from flag to empirical-observation looks like when you actually run the test.*

